WEBVTT

00:00:21.914 --> 00:00:22.875
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> What’s wrong with you?

00:00:23.211 --> 00:00:25.797
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Look, I made a mistake, OK?

00:00:37.281 --> 00:00:39.047
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Couldn’t you see it was a work photo?

00:00:39.281 --> 00:00:41.867
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I said I’m sorry, OK!

00:00:53.438 --> 00:00:54.946
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Are you annoyed that I’m successful?

00:00:55.531 --> 00:00:57.331
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> No, of course not.

00:01:08.852 --> 00:01:10.360
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> And what’s going on with Max?

00:01:13.203 --> 00:01:13.836
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Max?

00:01:15.031 --> 00:01:16.523
Oh, come on, Ben.

00:01:27.852 --> 00:01:29.875
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I feel like I don’t know who you are anymore.

00:01:30.789 --> 00:01:31.609
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> That’s not fair.

00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:45.609
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> If you don’t like who I am, then I…

00:01:46.945 --> 00:01:47.609
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Then what?